  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.28 Frost Pond. No person shall operate a motorboat at a rate of speed exceeding 10 miles per hour upon the waters of Frost Pond in the towns of Jaffrey and Dublin.\n\nSource. #2351, eff 4-25-83; ss by #3010, eff 5-2-85; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; ss by #5862, eff 7-1-94, EXPIRED: 7-1-00\n\nNew. #7798, eff 12-3-02; ss and moved by #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.24); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.26) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
